    "The official site verifies the Jaipur campus and official domain, but the programme catalogue is not internally consistent enough for a verified record.",
    "The current-looking plural certificate page lists Bakery and Confectionery, Bartending, Spoken English, Personality Development, Event Management, French Language, Photography and Film Production. A separate older official certificate-course page lists French, German, Spoken English, Personalty Development, Art & Painting, Event Management, Photography and Tally. Both pages remain publicly accessible and no current-year status is stated, so the certificate set requires manual review.",
    "The official diploma catalogue lists regular diplomas in Food & Beverage Service, Food Production, Front Office Operations, Housekeeping Operations and Hospitality and Hotel Management, plus one-year concurrent diploma offerings. Individual official pages verify the concurrent diploma details and durations; the regular diploma catalogue does not state durations or eligibility.",
    "The official Professional Courses page describes B.Voc (Tourism and Hotel Management) as a three-year UG vocational degree, but its dedicated official course URL currently redirects to the official 404 page; it is included as a verified programme family and requires manual confirmation.",
    "The Career Oriented Programs page also lists civil-services, railway, banking, PO and SSC coaching classes. These were not treated as degree, diploma or certificate programmes.",
    "Normal TLS was attempted first; curl returned the managed proxy certificate error 'self signed certificate in certificate chain'. Public GET requests then used --insecure only after confirming the requested official/search hostnames.",
    "Career mappings were generated from read-only queries against assets/data/career_path.db; the database was not edited. No non-official aggregator or social profile was used."
